#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use IBM Cloud Identity Access Management (IAM) to manage users with or without an IBM Cloud account"
msgstr "Gunakan IBM Cloud Identity Access Management (IAM) untuk mengelola pengguna dengan atau tanpa akun IBM Cloud"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Manage ID provider users"
msgstr "Kelola pengguna ID provider"

#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Manage ID provider users {#manage-id-provider-users}"
msgstr "Kelola pengguna ID provider {#manage-id-provider-users}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can integrate with your external identity provider (IDP) to securely authenticate external users to your IBM Cloud account. By using an external provider, you can provide a way for users in your company to use single sign-on (SSO). You can connect your cloud account to an external IDP one of the following ways:\n"
msgstr "Kamu bisa mengintegrasikan dengan identity provider (IDP) eksternal untuk mengautentikasi pengguna eksternal ke akun IBM Cloud secara aman. Dengan menggunakan provider eksternal, Anda bisa menyediakan cara bagi pengguna di perusahaanmu untuk menggunakan single sign-on (SSO). Kamu bisa menghubungkan akun cloud ke IDP eksternal dengan salah satu cara berikut:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use the [IBM Cloud&reg; SAML service provider (SP)](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-ibm-idp-integration#federate-cloud-saml)\n"
msgstr "Gunakan [IBM Cloud&reg; SAML service provider (SP)](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-ibm-idp-integration#federate-cloud-saml)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use [App ID](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-ibm-idp-integration#federate-appid) (might incur a cost)\n"
msgstr "Gunakan [App ID](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-ibm-idp-integration#federate-appid) (mungkin dikenakan biaya)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "[Federate your users to all IBM&reg; products with IBMid](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-ibm-idp-integration#federate-ibmid)\n"
msgstr "[Federasikan penggunamu ke semua produk IBM&reg; dengan IBMid](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-ibm-idp-integration#federate-ibmid)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\">\n"
"After connecting your IDP, you can set up dynamic rules so you don't have to manually add every user to every group when they join.  See [Enabling authentication from an external identity provider](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-ibm-idp-integration#app-id-dynamic-rules) for instructions.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\">\n"
"Setelah menghubungkan IDP, Anda bisa menyiapkan aturan dinamis sehingga tidak perlu menambahkan setiap pengguna ke setiap grup secara manual saat mereka bergabung. Lihat [Enabling authentication from an external identity provider](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-ibm-idp-integration#app-id-dynamic-rules) untuk instruksinya.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Next steps {#next-steps}"
msgstr "Langkah selanjutnya {#next-steps}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Recommendations\">\n"
"   * Refer to the [Enabling authentication from an external identity provider](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-ibm-idp-integration) topic.\n"
"   * See [IBM Cloud SAML Federation Guide](https://www.ibm.com/products/tutorials/ibm-cloud-saml-federation-guide) for more information.\n"
"   * Refer to the full [App ID documentation](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/appid?topic=appid-getting-started).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Rekomendasi\">\n"
"   * Lihat topik [Enabling authentication from an external identity provider](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-ibm-idp-integration).\n"
"   * Lihat [IBM Cloud SAML Federation Guide](https://www.ibm.com/products/tutorials/ibm-cloud-saml-federation-guide) untuk informasi lebih lanjut.\n"
"   * Lihat dokumentasi lengkap [App ID.](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/appid?topic=appid-getting-started)\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
